Additional attribution condition
--------------------------------
If you use these models in a project, or fine-tune, further train, or retrain
a model using these weights or adapting these models' architecture or
implementation, you must credit xiaohan-tian and KGAudioLab in that project's
README, documentation, or credits. When the project or resulting model is
published or distributed, that credit must accompany it and be reasonably
accessible to its users. Retain this license and attribution requirement
when redistributing these models or derivative model weights. Independently
developed models that do not use these weights, architecture, or
implementation are outside the scope of this condition.

The credit must identify the original author and organization and include
https://huggingface.co/KGAudioLab. Suggested wording:

"Uses or is derived from instrument-aire models by xiaohan-tian / KGAudioLab
(https://huggingface.co/KGAudioLab)."

Attribution does not imply endorsement by the author or organization.
